{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865520/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1754647205\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865520/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1754647205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865520/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1754647205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET POLLY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her soft skin smells like wildflower honey, and her gentle eyes are full of sweet trust. Polly doesn't try to be charming, she just is: shy, naive, and impossibly adorable. Her snug little costume hugs her cuddly curves, and her laughter rings like a bell every time she frolics in the grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In bed, Polly is perfectly obedient\u2014eager to follow your lead in any playful mischief. Fluffy handcuffs, a vibrating tail plug, and her favorite shepherd's crop\u2014those are her favorite accessories. Every day with Polly feels like a pastoral dream, and she'll be endlessly grateful for your affection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865520/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.avif?t=1754647205\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Polly as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'